      "title": "volume 与 weight",
      "summary": "体积；音量；卷；重量。",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "volume",
          "note": "体积、容量；也可指音量或卷",
          "example": {
            "id": "comparison-1",
            "senseId": "s1",
            "en": "The bottle has a large volume.",
            "zh": "瓶子容量大。"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "weight",
          "note": "重量，指物体有多重",
          "example": {
            "id": "comparison-2",
            "senseId": "s1",
            "en": "The empty bottle weighs very little.",
            "zh": "空瓶子很轻。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "takeaway": "volume 在此指体积或容量，即占据空间的大小；weight 指重量，即物体有多重。volume 另可指音量或书的一卷。",
